// ============================================================================
//  SPOOKYMAGIC.KN — BLACK-BOX / SPOOKY-MAGIC BEHAVIORS
//
//  For weird, multi-cause, or unexpected behaviors that produce "spooky magic"
//  — results that appear to come from nowhere, Heisenbugs, timing-dependent
//  failures, or behaviors that don't fit clean cause→effect modeling.
//
//  IMPORTED BY: cause.kn, effect.kn
//  IMPORTS:      None (standalone — no circular dependencies)
//
//  PATTERN:
//    Use this file when:
//    - A bug only reproduces 20% of the time
//    - The behavior changes based on seemingly unrelated code
//    - You need a black-box that produces surprising outputs
//    - Multiple causes converge to produce one "spooky" outcome
// ============================================================================

